  <item>
    <title>【英雄联盟LOL S15世界赛前瞻】T1 VS IG,创造新的历史--谁会是世界第一17强</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68edc2a8224325ea70205927</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68edc2a8224325ea70205927</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Oct 2025 04:04:30 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>S15入围赛10月14日首发名单：iG对T1，谁能获得瑞士轮门票</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs6g-Moqb6BPEIPXyMZ0G-Visc-C.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡拉、桂圆、水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="78">01:18</a> 大家好环节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a> 主播深深的内疚</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="375">06:15</a> 为什么说T1打IG是大热门比赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>1557是什么意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="600">10:00</a> 想不到T1还有什么能复仇的了？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="892">14:52</a> 上单到底有用没用</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1110">18:30</a> 无故言詹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 超级上单？抖音上单！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1648">27:28</a> 中文真的好学吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 还有没有这种巅峰期很短，但是相当惊艳的选手？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2373">39:33</a> IG组建全神班到底花了多少</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2824">47:04</a> 这次成都有华吗，我相信会有的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3112">51:52</a> 连续两年没有世界性赛事冠军意味着什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3296">54:56</a> 电竞存在种族天赋论吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3374">56:14</a> 本届赛事规则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4220">1:10:20</a> 一定要6冠呐</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP&amp;ED:Sacrifice(争)</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63c44a40c537070010021832/llbBt6QFbpiyqn6MzSVISFiZTmVB.m4a" length="71000246" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:13:05</itunes:duration>
