  <item>
    <title>【英雄联盟LOL】2025MSI季中赛前瞻，AL是哪来的小瘪三队伍？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685ed6e008d8fd85865c1484</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685ed6e008d8fd85865c1484</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 27 Jun 2025 18:08:44 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2025英雄联盟季中冠军赛在温哥华的太平洋体育馆举行。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目录制于6月24日，很抱歉在开赛前1小时才剪好发出。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo0hYcDhYttbFivrEQ_rUSWcz8cE.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大荒囚天指</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpgS_MtAl2Cs5QCeAGL0SS8bFdZF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>小荒囚天指</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lvh3uOIwPInEq7d2QnjXRkB-BiDt.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>全员指天这是要复刻S3了吗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnbeYS7YS3gTgdnxfOXoA0MmUBoC.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>bin哥这回闹剧结束了吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡拉、桂圆（客串版）、水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场牢香的励志解说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="157">02:37</a> 由于近期沉迷捞女游戏，三人录制变双人录制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="322">05:22</a> 正片开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="400">06:40</a> 介绍赛制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="456">07:36</a> 把他们全拖下水，咕噜咕噜~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="769">12:49</a> 顺利的话，很快的将迎来将对将，王对王</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1003">16:43</a> 主播平时真的很忙（狗头）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1214">20:14</a> Geng能否卫冕</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1474">24:34</a> 都得给兰神道歉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1664">27:44</a> 致敬传奇充电宝KT BDD</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1873">31:13</a> 石甲虫悟道真的假的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2001">33:21</a> 时常怀念，但也不会受缚于过去</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2108">35:08</a> 期待文老师的精彩表现</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> 几句题外话，惋惜今年的印第安纳步行者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3255">54:15</a> bin哥现在知道叫Tabe了不</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3388">56:28</a> Chovy怎么还没到你的时代</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3909">1:05:09</a> AL选手介绍</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5236">1:27:16</a> 香克斯去对抗超威结果如何呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5514">1:31:54</a> Bin哥这次是挑战者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5587">1:33:07</a> Tabe的赛后采访</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：英雄联盟 - Fight of Your Life</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/63c44a40c537070010021832/lgyqX-RCyORzodVScdWsYqiK9bLG.m4a" length="92220651" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:34:56</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgufpAzln8gTKrxwvw2px303SEU1.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【游戏公司系列】世界第一的游戏公司，任天堂？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/685ace5d2a38b4d979599b18</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">685ace5d2a38b4d979599b18</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Jun 2025 17:06:18 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目同样录制于劳动节，感谢毛磕Mock工作室提供录音场所</span></p><span></span><p><span>1889 年，即大清光绪十五年，年仅18岁的光绪皇帝正式亲政。彼时，虽其端坐在象征至高无上皇权的龙椅之上，然其尚未成为国家的实际主宰者。于同一时期的欧洲大陆，法国的埃菲尔铁塔这一标志性建筑宣告落成。而在同一时间同一地点，恩格斯主持召开了国际社会主义者代表大会，宣告了第二国际的正式成立，并将每年的5月1日确立为劳动节。在美国本杰明哈里森当任美国总统，华尔街日报发布首刊，而放眼我们东方的邻居--日本，在明治维新所掀起的改革浪潮之中，这一年日本正式通过了《帝国宪法》，正式标志日本有限的宪政统治。时年9月23日，一个名叫山内房治郎的30岁男人于京都创设了一家花牌店。此时的日本刚刚解除花牌禁令，山内房治郎敏锐捕捉到这一绝佳商业契机，准备狠赚一笔。在为店铺命名之际，其思索良久，最终秉持谋事在人、成事在天的理念，于 “花牌” 之前冠以 “任天堂”。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fmt1lJK4bSG1iU4FhrJ1Y-4NpJAb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>大统领花札</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltQEUYC073XNSXnCR_o2ilyZsEMT.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>超级怪手</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh5Up0MSnqF6ReYv49bYhiYL2W-S.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>山内溥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjL5qAVYJK_oRpfUjRGalk41KYhQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>横井军平</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FooofWwgbkipoh6gV1INKrnLVLGY.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>上村雅之</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn6-35iG4xGE4CXtpGvhOdaklg0z.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>米罗华奥德赛</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fpr9G2S0RXAaw5VIPkc7QffnCRan.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>太空侵略者</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjtRe09wekQPriexzOg1bQ_20u57.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>Game&amp;Watch</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/liGI7HkVicq4NyQbZ1AtECjSZKFH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>双屏Game&amp;Watch 大金刚版</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgWlXo42eogFUhTU_DS-Px4ovM3j.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>雅达利大崩溃</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡拉、桂圆、水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="199">03:19</a> 本期OP在这里开始</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="269">04:29</a> 感谢毛磕工作室协助</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="326">05:26</a> 米哈游爆了</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="390">06:30</a> 可怜的pokemon系列</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="428">07:08</a> 开始岁月史书</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="466">07:46</a> 初代，目山内房志郎登场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 水泥店梦开始的地方</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="618">10:18</a> 简单介绍下花札</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="802">13:22</a> 做第一个开花札店的人</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="958">15:58</a> 水泥陈尸生意还做不做</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1160">19:20</a> 日本烟草大王 村井吉兵位</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1204">20:04</a> 赌毒就得绑定啊</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 二代目山内积良登场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1565">26:05</a> 初代目山内房志郎逝世</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1808">30:08</a> 继承家业和自由自在你怎么选</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 最重要的三代目 山内溥登场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1931">32:11</a> 49年入国军怎么说</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2116">35:16</a> 二代目山内积良撒手人寰</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2336">38:56</a> 铁腕暴君山内溥</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2512">41:52</a> 东西方最强法务部第一次会见</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> 1962年任天堂上市</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2602">43:22</a> 任天堂跑偏时期</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3044">50:44</a> 横井军平登场</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3361">56:01</a> 任天堂硬件三杰到齐</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3450">57:30</a> 世界上第一台家用游戏机米罗华奥德赛</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3807">1:03:27</a> 街机崛起</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4088">1:08:08</a> 第一台掌机Game&amp;Watch上线</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4175">1:09:35</a> 十字键问世</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4693">1:18:13</a> 红白机的成功不需要什么证明，它本身就是证明</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4764">1:19:24</a> 一个录音事故，主播稿子遗失</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4924">1:22:04</a> 片尾彩蛋</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：近藤浩治 - Ground Stage</span></p><span></span><p><span>【参考资料】</span></p><span></span><p><span>任天堂哲学</span></p><span></span><p><span>岩田先生</span></p><span></span><p><span>任天堂档案</span></p><span></span><p><span>Bilibili 智能路障</span></p><span></span><p><span>半拿铁 | 商业沉浮录</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内容如与现实有任何出入，请听众在评论区指出，期待各位留言</span></p>]]></description>
