    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期节目录制于2月18日，有些许回旋镖还望理解</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FquwHpEwgFj8fj_iYIDJY69t2ygm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>被线杀的Keria</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡拉、桂圆、水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 肠胃炎开局</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 小飞啊，不行下赛季来宙哥这吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="372">06:12</a> 理性讨论现在哪个位置最缺人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="511">08:31</a> 多兰你别退役，理性讨论多兰强度</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="649">10:49</a> T1下一个基石是谁</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="915">15:15</a> 压力二相性</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 宙斯离队guma下放</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1129">18:49</a> 还是那句话，撸养农小，农养撸老</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1535">25:35</a> 会跳脸打输出的AD选手还有谁（明知故问）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1814">30:14</a> 致敬传奇世界第一升起太阳上单斌哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1916">31:56</a> T1战狼也得替补</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2125">35:25</a> 叛忍王宙斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2397">39:57</a> 宙斯你为什么不笑（愤怒愤怒）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2473">41:13</a> LPL旧闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a> LPL新人频出，是否是最好的一年</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2655">44:15</a> 我们不可一世的BLG倒拉</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2674">44:34</a> 我还是支持AL去韩国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2726">45:26</a> 理性讨论大司马是不是绝活哥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2856">47:36</a> 给Chovy道歉，致敬舍利子之神</span></p>]]></description>
