  <item>
    <title>【英雄联盟LOL】迟到的2024年终总结以及中国电竞热度的巅峰（上）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677aa11d1e823e72d368fd54</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677aa11d1e823e72d368fd54</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jan 2025 15:16:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FspUqIa49pw7KzkGtA6G6V7rad6p.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>17R</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsSklLDiFRTn4TAsrqSLALWMIlIr.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>18R</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft2IkpP2_XNo6hY9nsLaEcxVD5p4.webp"></figure><span></span><p><span>还得是这张《我们是冠军！》</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgbbh1g0YF5iZFQafzqZHsocAL3N.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>这张差点漏了</span></p><span></span><p><span>RNG战队在2018年LPL春季赛上一穿四成功夺冠，并小组第一身份进入2018年MSI季中邀请赛决赛，以<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="181">3:1</a>战胜了韩国KZ战队夺得冠军；6月，在珠海举办的德玛西亚杯夏季赛上RNG战队以大比分全胜的战绩取得冠军；7月，在大连举办的亚洲对抗赛决赛，RNG豪取两分帮助LPL逆转，成功卫冕；9月，在南京举办的2018LPL夏季赛决赛，RNG以比分<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="182">3:2</a>击败IG，完成春夏双冠 ，以LPL一号种子身份进入S8全球总决赛；同年10月，英雄联盟S8全球总决赛8强赛上，RNG战队不敌G2战队，止步8强。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【本期主播】</span></p><span></span><p><span>卡拉、桂圆、水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【后期剪辑】</span></p><span></span><p><span>水獭人</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="42">00:42</a> 年终总结鸣谢听众</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 正片开始</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> 致敬RNG传奇教练风之BP-Firefox</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="791">13:11</a> 合同神初见端倪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1150">19:10</a> 也许有一天，我是说也许。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1335">22:15</a> 竟业合同要不要签家人们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1456">24:16</a> Firefox 幻想IF线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1731">28:51</a> 哥的炼金吊不吊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1956">32:36</a> Uzi成神之战，水银还有十秒，虚空之握通冥府，一声羊来开天门</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> WE传奇积分王-王杰</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2225">37:05</a> LPL的S赛首冠一定就是RNG吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2389">39:49</a> 休息室名场面</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2421">40:21</a> 2018年10月20号，谁也没有想到，谁也没有想到</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2981">49:41</a> 电竞联姻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3063">51:03</a> 很抱歉，请大家收听下半期</span></p><span></span><p><span>OP：徐梦圆 - China-E</span></p>]]></description>
